        {
          "text": "Yi dria alu alu eji feta yini, imvu dahaburu piyi imvu meleru be, bongo pie, afa suza ombani pie, afa aji be arikariru pie, akanya pie, akanya farasiru pie, eli vusi eli vusi yi eji afa yini ma kalafe ’dipi.",
